item.modularnuclear.radiovoltaic.plate.hv.desc=Converts absorbed neutron flux into direct HV electricity\nMax output: 1,024 EU/t (2A HV)
item.modularnuclear.radiovoltaic.plate.ev.desc=Converts absorbed neutron flux into direct EV electricity\nMax output: 4,096 EU/t (2A EV)
item.modularnuclear.radiovoltaic.plate.common.desc=Absorbs 100%% of incident neutron flux\nFast neutrons yield 4x EU vs thermal neutrons\nExcess absorbed energy converts into heat
item.modularnuclear.sensorcard.target=Target: [%d, %d, %d]
item.modularnuclear.sensorcard.unlinked=Unlinked. Right-click on MPTR reactor to bind.
item.modularnuclear.sensorkit.desc=Right-click on MPTR reactor to link and create sensor card

